Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.62,0:00:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right,\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had\Nwere about to collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.76,0:00:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody here\Nknows it for certain So
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.56,0:00:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,close your eyes and breathe\Nin deeply And listen to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Your soul. You'll see a\Npath in front of you. And
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll know just where you\Nneed to go So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.32,0:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.74,0:01:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And make us stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.42,0:01:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way, that's what's\Nbest for me. And you do it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's got to\Nbe. We're moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,now I'm ready But at times it's okay to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,get help on the way For the future ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.98,0:01:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,burning bright For what's ahead you\Nsee Is beyond your wildest dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.24,0:01:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,reach out your hand Cut through the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.66,0:01:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And make a stand. Don't\Nlet the darkness win,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.24,0:01:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,just break through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.36,0:01:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The best that we know. With tears\Nand doubts and tone. We'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,where we all wanna go The page
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.00,0:01:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,within brings colors of our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.56,0:02:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I can't push it back,\Nperhaps I can stop its advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.24,0:02:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or even better, I can\Nchange its direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.22,0:02:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my duty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.14,0:02:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No one else can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I must!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The capital will not be\Ndestroyed under my watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.88,0:02:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,As its rightful Shogun, I will guide\Nthe land of Wano to a new dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.98,0:02:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He shot beams from his eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.18,0:03:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everyone alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.08,0:03:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we need to find a new spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.28,0:03:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us retreat further back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Chi-Chi's gone! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.74,0:03:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I lose him in the explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to search.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.46,0:03:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know when another might hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.42,0:03:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I might die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to leave\Nhim here. I'm sorry! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.62,0:03:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet you know this one too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Henry Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.52,0:04:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that Niji's move?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're catching on, Vin's smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you clever?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen, don't give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did I ace the test or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can tell, I did thorough\Nresearch on all of Jamba's tech.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I can replicate any move that your\Nbrothers do, except not make it look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care, I cut ties with those jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The idea was to show it to\Nyou after you transform,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,but you really screwed that up for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.60,0:05:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kicking your ass is one thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.36,0:05:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't really stick it to\NJudge unless I beat you in the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.98,0:05:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd prove my superiority\Nbeyond a shadow of a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a crap\Nabout your dumb rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.60,0:05:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm starting to\Nthink that you don't like me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.18,0:05:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Twins!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.70,0:05:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.92,0:05:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I nailed it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You've probably been on the\Nreceiving end of that one before!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My beautiful arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.34,0:06:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, punk. It's on.\NNow what did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,keep talking about those bastards\Nand this is what you get oh you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,telling me i gotta watch what i\Nsay because you're too sensitive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.78,0:06:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me make one thing clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.58,0:06:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Suit or no suit, you're going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.68,0:06:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got everything I need right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's end this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.36,0:06:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's save!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Strike! Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.14,0:06:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,what makes you think\Nyou have the upper hand
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.50,0:06:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,did you forget i sent your ass flying\Nonce already and i can do it again
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.56,0:07:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,it wasn't enough to win but i know that\Nhurt we've been fighting for a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you must be wearing down i'm ready like
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.08,0:07:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,it or not i've already accepted my fate
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.02,0:07:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not the same guy you fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.24,0:07:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Inferious! Weaklit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.98,0:07:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You ain't never had a foe like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.92,0:07:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're not gonna use it, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Stealth Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You really can do it all, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Your back is wide open, Finn Smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.80,0:07:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.78,0:07:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did he disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But he doesn't have to soon anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.54,0:07:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be moving so fast\Nhe's become invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll run out of stamina soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.74,0:08:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll have to show himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.98,0:08:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't think this one through, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.28,0:08:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the hell out of here, rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.56,0:08:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Choo-chee!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness you're okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.40,0:08:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.68,0:08:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry to a safe spot\Nbefore those two start fighting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Osame!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.61,0:08:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That trap is still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now where did you run off to, Thinsmoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.54,0:08:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you help me, whoever you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.90,0:08:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I have nothing to do with this,\NI'm just a geisha from the Capitol!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.02,0:09:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome man, you're supposed to be in bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I came by asking for your services,\Nand they said you had a headache!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.98,0:09:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you look nice and healthy\Nto me, you filthy little liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I try to be a good customer to\Nyou, and this is what I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.60,0:09:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Rejection and deception?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're getting too\Ncocky for your own good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You were supposed to be my number\None girl now that Komurasaki is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You pay for lying to me, and for\Nall those times you turned me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is divine punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.70,0:09:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your behavior required\Nswift and punitive action.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.80,0:09:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Justice has been served.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.90,0:10:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not showing an ounce of remorse!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.82,0:10:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I need to\Npunish you a second time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.72,0:10:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about what you've gained.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.86,0:10:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,An exoskeleton, muscle strength and\Nmobility, more tools in my arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.02,0:10:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If I fine-tune my armament Haki\Nand cover my exoskeleton with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My legs will become stronger than ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.52,0:10:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be capable of supporting\Neven hotter flames than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.68,0:10:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Ifrit Jabra!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster acceleration, heavier weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.62,0:10:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any more doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know that a man\Nshould never hit a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.82,0:10:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's been a fact since\Nthe age of dinosaurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.44,0:10:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known, scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.20,0:10:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Call Yang Kong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did Master Tweet come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.72,0:11:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, just leave him to me. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.24,0:11:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are, Venn Smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.06,0:11:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.40,0:11:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.90,0:12:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that has been smoke power\Nfive ever three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.06,0:12:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're still trying to\Ndeny the truth, Jeremiah boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.94,0:12:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one in denial.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm my own man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Repeating that crap doesn't make it true.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.24,0:12:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This dish still needs its final touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.12,0:12:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinosaur meat's tough, but\Nthere's nothing I can't cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.20,0:12:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a failed cyborg and a failed human!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't lose to a\Nsecond-rate science project!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.40,0:12:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get lost, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the hell is going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Your little friend is safe, Gigi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.18,0:13:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you keep him safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.82,0:13:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji was making some\Nof that rat food again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.38,0:13:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And you take good care of her too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wound?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.82,0:14:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not still pleading, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.62,0:14:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We need help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone bring a first aid, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.00,0:14:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just remember, our mother selflessly gave\Nher life to protect you and your humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.10,0:14:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're kinder\Nand more tender than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,the battle in the\Npleasure hall of the skull
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.52,0:14:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,dome has come to an\Nend the winner is sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,i thought so something happens when the\Nflames on his back go out he speeds up
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.46,0:15:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But his defense, on the\Nother hand, gets weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.54,0:15:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He destroyed Master King's mask. Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.02,0:15:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks like the\Nrumors about him are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.50,0:15:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Black wings, white hair, brown skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If we tipped off the government, we'd\Nget a hundred million bear rebounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hypothetically, that is\NImperial Flaming Wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.02,0:15:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,The castle's already burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.88,0:15:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta keep your cool and set an\Nexample for your men, not set them on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not step outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.94,0:15:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem a little tense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That hundred million berry\Nthing really got to you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.54,0:15:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell of a bounty for intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What tribe are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Why bother asking when\Nyou're about to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.24,0:16:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever his tribe is, it must be rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.10,0:16:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.78,0:16:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to find a way to beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.32,0:16:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.30,0:16:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.90,0:16:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But this goes on much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.72,0:16:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A sword will kill me before he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.84,0:16:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You are far more\Ndangerous than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.22,0:16:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, same.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.48,0:16:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Your reign has gone on for long\Nenough, as tyrants end as pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:16:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather arrogant, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Kaido's destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.22,0:17:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He will become the king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.98,0:17:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but that dream ends here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.34,0:17:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,King of Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.32,0:17:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.48,0:17:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigiri!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.48,0:17:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me this life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.66,0:17:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I see why the world\Ngovernment won't let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.56,0:18:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a Lunarian, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.58,0:18:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw your durability test earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.72,0:18:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting out of this dump, and then\NI'm going to start a new pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do, guinea pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.52,0:18:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn this\Nboring world upside down,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.04,0:18:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,if you want to come, that's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.34,0:18:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Change the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.40,0:18:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:19:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The test subjects are\Nescaping the facility!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them at any cost! Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking the shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.60,0:19:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No, they sure aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.64,0:19:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The bullets don't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.84,0:19:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.36,0:19:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.68,0:19:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, I almost forgot to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.66,0:19:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.28,0:19:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Albear.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.84,0:19:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Albear, you're very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, from here on out, I'll call you king.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.20,0:19:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You watch my back, and I'll watch yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.40,0:20:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never sell you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.62,0:20:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my right-hand man to the end, king.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.18,0:20:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This world only has food for one ruler!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.56,0:20:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The flames are burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't attack him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.88,0:20:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Die, Ramen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.38,0:20:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Flaming Wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.94,0:20:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell was that? Magma?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.98,0:21:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.16,0:21:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,These swords are treasures!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.44,0:21:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting them go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's bent up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.42,0:21:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can cut him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.90,0:22:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,See, you figured out my trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.04,0:22:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's very clever of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.52,0:22:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're damn right I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.38,0:22:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now nothing can stop me from beating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.06,0:22:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.42,0:22:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultra!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:22:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiger trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.96,0:23:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you trying to block me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.92,0:23:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.18,0:23:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Or are you scared what\Nmight attack my duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.72,0:23:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.88,0:24:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You are biologically\Nincapable of defeating me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.50,0:24:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaming biologists is a weak excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.36,0:24:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't limit myself like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.74,0:24:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall remember you for your brave\Nresorts, or your arrogance, I should say.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.50,0:24:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll carve it into your memory myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.02,0:24:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I seriously have\Nyou lived through this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.50,0:24:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Bellamy Frames!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.06,0:24:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.42,0:25:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,King of Hell, Three-Sword Serpents!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.68,0:25:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,One hundred and three mercies!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.06,0:25:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end for you, Rolodawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.58,0:25:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon, damnation!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.86,0:26:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kaido... I don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.78,0:26:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.36,0:26:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still holding\Non to that, Dream King?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.06,0:26:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think I'm Joy Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.30,0:26:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm not complaining here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.04,0:26:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you sure the world I'm looking\Nto make is the one that you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.54,0:26:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, a legend is just a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.86,0:26:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And I could never ask for\Nmore than you've given me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.58,0:26:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alive because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.88,0:26:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My life is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.02,0:26:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So you must remain undefeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.92,0:26:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.34,0:26:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.40,0:27:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that you need nothing less than\Nthe greatest swordsman in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.82,0:27:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,So until the day comes when I defeat\Nhim and take his title, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.00,0:27:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you that i will never lose again
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.20,0:27:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,is that okay king of the pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.80,0:27:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I will become
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.34,0:27:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,the king of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.76,0:28:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle of the Ritebring Tower outside\Nthe Skull Dome has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.04,0:28:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.90,0:28:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
